1572
00:58:42,478 --> 00:58:43,210
I mean, I think--

1573
00:58:43,210 --> 00:58:45,168
so I think that there's
roughly two algorithms.

1574
00:58:45,168 --> 00:58:47,438
One is this algorithm we
saw in the one-layer model.

1575
00:58:47,438 --> 00:58:49,730
And we see it in other models
too, especially early on,

1576
00:58:49,730 --> 00:58:51,980
which is just, try to copy--

1577
00:58:51,980 --> 00:58:52,720
