1578
00:58:52,720 --> 00:58:55,330
Probably, a similar word
is going to happen later.

1579
00:58:55,330 --> 00:58:57,130
Look for places
that it might fit in

1580
00:58:57,130 --> 00:58:58,360
and increase the probability.

1581
00:58:58,360 --> 00:58:59,810
So that's one thing that we see.

1582
00:58:59,810 --> 00:59:02,920
And the other thing we
see is induction heads,

1583
00:59:02,920 --> 00:59:05,410
which you can just summarize
