1584
00:59:05,410 --> 00:59:07,030
neighbors, basically.

1585
00:59:07,030 --> 00:59:09,340
And it seems-- possibly,
there's other things.

1586
00:59:09,340 --> 00:59:11,710
But it seems like
those two algorithms,

1587
00:59:11,710 --> 00:59:14,743
in the specific instantiations
